; border-top-color: #689c3a; font-size: 1.2rem;\">PTSD</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    你不必忘记，但你可以<br>学会生活在过去之外\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #ffe8cd;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">强迫症</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #f4871b; border-top-color: #f4871b; font-size: 1.2rem;\">OCD</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    不要让强迫控制你，<br>你可以控制强迫。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3 -->\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #e3effc;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">双相情感障碍</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #389b9d; border-top-color: #389b9d;\">BIPOLAR</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    黑暗会过去，<br>黎明会到来。<br>\n                    <span class=\"author\">-乔治·戈登·拜伦</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #e5dbf7;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">失眠症</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #8c4ad6; border-top-color: #8c4ad6;\">INSOMNIA<br>DISORDER</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    即使黑夜漫长，<br>你仍然有力量<br>迎接黎明的曙光。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 4 -->\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #fff4cc;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">进食障碍</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #d6d329; border-top-color: #d6d329;\">EATING<br>DISORDER</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    用爱和关怀填充你的<br>盘子，让自由和平衡的<br>味道充满你的生活。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #dcf0fd;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">精神分裂症</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #4b92c9; border-top-color: #4b92c9; font-size: 0.75rem;\">SCHIZOPHRENIA</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    我并不疯狂，<br>只是在一个我自己<br>创造的世界里生活。<br>\n                    <span class=\"author\">- 弗里茨·佩尔斯</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 5 -->\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #fbdbd5;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">边缘人格障碍</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #ef4f26; border-top-color: #ef4f26; font-size: 1.2rem;\">BPD</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n                    Borderline Personality<br>Disorder\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cell\" style=\"background-color: #d4f2d7;\">\n            <div class=\"cell-title\">妄想性人格障碍</div>\n            <div class=\"cell-content\">\n                <div class=\"brain-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: #35ae35; border-top-color: #35ae35; font-size: 1.2rem;\">PPD</div>\n                <div class=\"desc\">\n                    在现实和想象之间<br>找到平衡，让现实的<br>光芒驱散妄想的阴影。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <span>@ 晓老师 成长教练</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
